  <div><strong>网页 / FastAPI</strong><span>会话、上传与任务 ID</span></div>
  <div><strong>Temporal</strong><span>持久工作流与任务队列</span></div>
  <div><strong>CPU / GPU 工作进程</strong><span>编排、检测、复检和证据</span></div>
